{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今（21日）早上近8時，一輛校巴在九龍沿西區海底隧道往港島方向行駛，期間在快線近入口位置與一輛客貨車相撞。救援人員接報到場，事件中無學童受傷，一名客貨車司機報稱腳受傷。警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"一輛校巴及客貨車在西區海底隧道近入口位置相撞。（HeiHei Poon／馬路的事(即時交通資訊區））\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189489923581808640194372.jpeg/1Z5e_H3eBbW1QfjqnEPU6KuZ0VMYbJGNFPGHzRTxh80\"/><figcaption>一輛校巴及客貨車在西區海底隧道近入口位置相撞。（HeiHei Poon／馬路的事(即時交通資訊區））</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T00:58:54.479303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:38:08.602143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T00:57:38.313777+00:00","content_hash":"7e3d49b716db41c1c7d986177464b714ac0dff1aff4bafce01a6f58357764926","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}